                "description": "Ultra minimalistic in design, this door lever made by Omnia is sure to add a chic touch to any home. Not even the installation screws are visible, because this Chic Leverset with Square Rose features concealed mounting screws. The most prominent trait of this Modern Chic Leverset is the modern square rose; and since it is available in a wide array of contemporary finishes, you will be sure to find just the color to fit into your home decor.\r\n",
